"Le canal SMS n'est pas configuré sur cette instance — voir Configuration › "
"Paramètres. Le courriel reste disponible."

#. module: bf_securetransfer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_securetransfer.field_res_config_settings__st_sms_creds_status
msgid ""
"The VoIP.ms API user and password are declared in odoo.conf "
"(bf_securetransfer_voipms_user / _password) or in environment variables, "
"never in the database."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur et le mot de passe de l'API VoIP.ms se déclarent dans "
"odoo.conf (bf_securetransfer_voipms_user / _password) ou en variables "
"d'environnement — jamais en base de données."

#. module: bf_securetransfer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"The VoIP.ms API user and password are declared in odoo.conf "
"(bf_securetransfer_voipms_user / _password), never in the database."
msgstr ""
"L'utilisateur et le mot de passe de l'API VoIP.ms se déclarent dans "
"odoo.conf (bf_securetransfer_voipms_user / _password), jamais en base."

#. module: bf_securetransfer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"The access keys are set in <code>odoo.conf</code>\n"
"                                (<code>bf_securetransfer_s3_access_key</code> /\n"
"                                <code>bf_securetransfer_s3_secret_key</code>) or in the environment\n"
"                                variables (<code>BF_SECURETRANSFER_S3_ACCESS_KEY</code> /\n"
"                                <code>BF_SECURETRANSFER_S3_SECRET_KEY</code>, which take priority),\n"
"                                <strong>never in the database</strong>: a dump or a staging\n"
"                                refresh would carry off the production keys."
msgstr ""
"Les clés d'accès se définissent dans <code>odoo.conf</code>\n"
"                                (<code>bf_securetransfer_s3_access_key</code> /\n"
"                                <code>bf_securetransfer_s3_secret_key</code>) ou dans les variables\n"
"                                d'environnement (<code>BF_SECURETRANSFER_S3_ACCESS_KEY</code> /\n"
"                                <code>BF_SECURETRANSFER_S3_SECRET_KEY</code>, prioritaires) —\n"
"                                <strong>jamais en base de données</strong> : un dump ou un refresh\n"
"                                staging emporterait les clés de production."

