"Le type de dossier visé, pas les valeurs — elles sont juste au-dessus."

#. module: bf_securetransfer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer.secure_transfer_view_form
msgid ""
"The link email goes back out to each recipient, in their language. The "
"receipt is not re-sent to the sender. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Le courriel de lien repart à chaque destinataire, dans sa langue. L'accusé "
