"The link stops working as soon as a recipient has downloaded every file in "
"the transfer."
msgstr ""
"Le lien cesse de fonctionner dès qu'un\n"
"                                            destinataire a téléchargé tous les fichiers de l'envoi."

#. module: bf_securetransfer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer.secure_send_wizard_view_form
